[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2444608657","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98638#issuecomment-2444608657","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98638","id":2444608657,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RtcSR","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-29T15:28:15Z","updated_at":"2024-10-29T15:28:15Z","body":"What does your extension registration method look like? It seems like you're registering this class under the wrong initialization level, it should be like this:\r\n```cpp\r\nvoid initialize_example_module(ModuleInitializationLevel p_level) {\r\n\tif (p_level != MODULE_INITIALIZATION_LEVEL_SCENE) {\r\n\t\treturn;\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\tGDREGISTER_CLASS(BoxNode3D);\r\n}\r\n```\r\nIf you want to register it under the scene level, if you instead register it under the editor level (which I think would happen if you don't check at all) it will be an editor only class\r\n\r\nSo please check this, or show your initialization method","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2444608657/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2444689805","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98638#issuecomment-2444689805","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98638","id":2444689805,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RtwGN","user":{"login":"CycloneRing","id":91777373,"node_id":"U_kgDOBXhpXQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91777373?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing","html_url":"https://github.com/CycloneRing","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-29T15:54:55Z","updated_at":"2024-10-29T15:55:41Z","body":"@AThousandShips They are not registered at initialization, They are registered later mid game. If any extension registered later  marked as editor there must be an option to define they are for runtime.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2444689805/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2444694332","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98638#issuecomment-2444694332","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98638","id":2444694332,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RtxM8","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-29T15:56:41Z","updated_at":"2024-10-29T15:57:15Z","body":"Registered during runtime? That doesn't sound like something that's supported, it is not a valid way that I know of at least\r\n\r\nWhere did you find that this was supported?\r\n\r\nBut in either case you need to provide a minimal project with the way you're doing this for this to be testable, the details given are not enough","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2444694332/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2445188430","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98638#issuecomment-2445188430","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98638","id":2445188430,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Rvp1O","user":{"login":"CycloneRing","id":91777373,"node_id":"U_kgDOBXhpXQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91777373?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing","html_url":"https://github.com/CycloneRing","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-29T19:46:10Z","updated_at":"2024-10-29T19:46:10Z","body":"@AThousandShips It's part of [J.E.N.O.V.A project](https://github.com/Jenova-Framework). Real-Time C++ Scripting for Godot 4. It allows nested GDExtension and Editor Plugin development.\r\n\r\nI faced the issue today and I investigated with lead developer and found out about this.\r\n\r\nI believe this is something necessary, We should be able to register classes outside of Initialize event callback and set the flag, Author of Jenova is working on implementing a way to set this information by API I think he will make a pull request soon.\r\n \r\nAs a C++ developer I found jenova very powerful in my godot development pipeline and I wish there will be some consideration for current design, It's not flexible.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2445188430/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2445195377","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98638#issuecomment-2445195377","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98638","id":2445195377,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Rvrhx","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-29T19:50:10Z","updated_at":"2024-10-29T19:50:10Z","body":"That's something I think should be a [proposal](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals), from everything I can find in the code and documentation nothing is designed to do this, so it's not compatible with how Godot works\r\n\r\nSo either this requires new functionality outside of what extensions are designed for, or workarounds to work *with* how Godot works\r\n\r\nCC @dsnopek am I missing some intended feature or detail here?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2445195377/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2445201657","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98638#issuecomment-2445201657","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98638","id":2445201657,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RvtD5","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-29T19:53:46Z","updated_at":"2024-10-29T19:53:46Z","body":"> I did a test and commented check for API_EDITOR_EXTENSION  and it worked perfectly fine.\r\nI think best we can do is to rename API_EDITOR_EXTENSION  to API_EXTENSION and skip the checks for extensions at runtime or extensions classes can be defined as EDITOR_ONLY, CORE_ONLY and EDITOR_AND_CORE but it requires more work and get stuff more complicated.\r\n\r\nRegardless this suggestion is not a viable solution ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2445201657/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2445261838","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98638#issuecomment-2445261838","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98638","id":2445261838,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Rv7wO","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-29T20:25:17Z","updated_at":"2024-10-29T20:25:17Z","body":"> They are not registered at initialization, They are registered later mid game. If any extension registered later marked as editor there must be an option to define they are for runtime.\r\n\r\nWhile it's supported to load a whole GDExtension at any time after Godot has started, it is currently assumed that all class registration will take place during a GDExtension's init callback. If you need to add (or remove) classes later, it's expected that the whole GDExtension will be reloaded - not that individual classes will be added or removed dynamically.\r\n\r\n(Perhaps it would be worth adding something to `GDExtension::_register_extension_class_internal()` that gives an error if it's not called during the extension's init callback? That would help to make the current assumptions/expectations clear.)\r\n\r\nSo, I agree with @AThousandShips, that if we want to change this, it needs to be discussed in a proposal first, because the changes proposed here don't work with the way that GDExtension is currently expected to be used.\r\n\r\nI don't know much about your project, but perhaps your extension would be better off using the scripting API, rather than registering classes via `ClassDB`? The scripting API allows for things to be a lot more dynamic.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2445261838/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2445392190","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98638#issuecomment-2445392190","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98638","id":2445392190,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Rwbk-","user":{"login":"CycloneRing","id":91777373,"node_id":"U_kgDOBXhpXQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91777373?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing","html_url":"https://github.com/CycloneRing","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CycloneRing/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-29T21:47:53Z","updated_at":"2024-10-29T21:49:51Z","body":"@dsnopek Hi David, Registered classes work perfectly with current implementation in mid game however this issue only happens when instantiating a packed scene containing one of these classes.\r\nI do not directly call ClassDB, PackedScene::instantiate does. If only there was access to ClassInfo from GDX it could make us to set the flag to API_CORE or something like API_SCENE.\r\n\r\n> The scripting API allows for things to be a lot more dynamic.\r\n\r\nHere's the thing, Jenova is C++ Scripting, It's made to avoid using GDScript, It's possible to do C++ at real-time with hot-reloading and stuff.\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QnX8RZW9Jiw","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2445392190/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2815805544","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98638#issuecomment-2815805544","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98638","id":2815805544,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n1cho","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-18T16:28:42Z","updated_at":"2025-04-18T16:28:42Z","body":"Please open a proposal as suggested, closing this as this is proposal material","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2815805544/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]